      "hash": "57e02b438c71cf5e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Team Rocket is in an uproar over some intruder.\\nThat’s you, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t011r0405_staffm_01_02",
      "hash": "57e02a438c71cdab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Team Rocket took off!\\nDid you get rid of them?\\r\\nThank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t011r0403_report_01",
      "hash": "6dc4c69aafae409f",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a Pokémon Report!\\c\\nThe research section succeeded in creating\\nPorygon, an artificial Pokémon created\\r\\nby humans."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t011r0403_report_02",
      "hash": "6dc4c79aafae4252",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a Pokémon Report!\\c\\nOver 200 Pokémon moves have been confirmed."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t011r0403_report_03",
      "hash": "6dc4c89aafae4405",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a Pokémon Report!\\c\\nSome Pokémon have been confirmed to evolve\\nwhen they are traded."
    },
    {
